<title>USA: Montgomery launches Asia fund.</title>
<headline>Montgomery launches Asia fund.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Funds said it launched the Montgomery Emerging Asia Fund.</p>
<p>It said the fund will focus on long-term economic growth predicted in China, Hong Kong, Singapore, Thailand, and India.</p>
<p>Montgomery manages 18 no-load funds, and has about $7 billion under management.  </p>
<p>The fund will be at least 65 percent invested in equities.</p>
